          "source_excerpt": "641: class CRPGClass: public CDBRecord\n642: {\n643: \tOBJECT_BASIC_METHODS(CRPGClass);\n644: public:\n645: \tZDATA_(CDBRecord)\n646: \tint nPerkTreeID;\n647: \tSRPGSkills skills;\n648: \t////\n649: \tCPtr<CString> pToolTip;\n650: \tCPtr<CUITexture> pIcon;\n651: \tCPtr<CUITexture> pIconDisabled;\n652: \tCPtr<CUIContainer> pPerksPanel;\n653: \tZEND int operator&( CStructureSaver &f ) { f.Add(1,(CDBRecord*)this); f.Add(2,&nPerkTreeID); f.Add(3,&skills); f.Add(4,&pToolTip); f.Add(5,&pIcon); f.Add(6,&pIconDisabled); f.Add(7,&pPerksPanel); return 0; }\n654: \tvirtual void Import();",
          "file_sha256": "d979caabe329a85dcb3b30e6de515390345674fa9d20b347eef4c04e9f78b89b"
